Bundled LD/SBE kernels and independent regression references originate from
SALMON-TDDFT/SALMON2. Exact upstream and integration revisions are recorded in
runtime/source.json. The single maintained solver tree is runtime/sources/solver, with its own
LICENSE, LICENSE.THIRD-PARTY and ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS. Completed changes are integrated
there. Frozen source/override histories are recorded in runtime/source-history
and Git history. HSE support uses only the fast-PR implementation.

Binary wheels may bundle compiler/BLAS runtimes under their respective licenses;
see packaging/ld/licenses and LICENSE.THIRD-PARTY.

